pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$paper"
notes: |
  这一页用四个读数回答“全年干得怎么样”：流量 96.8% 接近预期；增速 +14.2% 由订阅驱动；水位（经营性现金流）三年来首次回到警戒线以上；险滩是华东续约率 78%，距 85% 警戒线还差 7 个刻度，这是 2026 年最优先的结构性问题。
elements:
  - elementId: eyebrow
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 40, 400, 18]
    content:
      style: "$eyebrow"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 远川 2025 · 水文年报

  - elementId: meta-right
    elementType: text
    bounds: [600, 40, 300, 18]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      fontSize: 10
      align: [right, middle]
      text: 里程 K1 / K7

  - elementId: station-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 62, 600, 46]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      fontSize: 30
      bold: true
      color: "$ink"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><span style="color:$gold;">K1</span>　水文快报</p>

  - elementId: conclusion
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 116, 840, 24]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 全年四个关键读数：流量接近预期，水位回到警戒线以上；险滩集中在华东河段。

  - elementId: header-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 152, 840, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

